      {
        "id": 21510,
        "name": "Blossercubbles",
        "username": "Blossercubbles",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/blossercubbles/{size}/1863_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-17T23:01:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Going through the catalogue of current villains with a random team of three in a random environment is a very exciting endeavor, but I'm doing this solely because I'm solo and need to keep the challenge higher, since my experience won't be heightened by me talking with myself and sharing awesome happenings at the table. When I play with others, we generally stick to basic, unless we're fighting the Good Baron, or there are five of us.</p>",
