      {
        "id": 21511,
        "name": "flamethrower49",
        "username": "flamethrower49",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-18T17:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Even tough-talking hardasses like me try to take it easy sometimes. &nbsp;Last night, a friend wanted to play against Voss, and I actually didn't feel like advanced. &nbsp;Three heroes tried basic, and got stomped. &nbsp;Then three more, then three more, then three more. &nbsp;We went through 12 heroes in this way. &nbsp;Some may have had a chance, others did not. &nbsp;I was angry at the game that started Psi-Weaver, Psi-Weaver, Frosthound, Conqueror. Using the last heroes we hadn't used, Wraith, Fanatic, and the Argent Adept coasted to victory in the Realm of Discord on the back of an Infrared Eyepiece, as well as Emboldened Argent Adept. &nbsp;</p><p>I dreamed of fighting Voss all night. &nbsp;It was horrible. &nbsp;How I ever used three heroes to beat his Advanced mode, I wonder. &nbsp;I'll have to go back to that someday. &nbsp;But when I stop dreaming about him.</p>",
