      {
        "id": 21513,
        "name": "TheSoundOfTrees",
        "username": "TheSoundOfTrees",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-18T18:49:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It doesn't happen often, but I've seen even \"normal\" Baron Blade completely eradicate heroes. A combination of backlash fields, force fields and the cards that destroy equipment can be deadly if played at the \"right\" time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit : I just wrote in another thread that, for me, it feels like the Rook City villains are as difficult in Normal than other Villains in advanced - like if they were not really balanced in the same way than other Villains before and after.</p>",
