        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-19T05:41:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TheSoundOfTrees\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheSoundOfTrees:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;Edit : I just wrote in another thread that, for me, it feels like the Rook City villains are as difficult in Normal than other Villains in advanced - like if they were not really balanced in the same way than other Villains before and after.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Wouldn't you expect that, given their difficulty levels? The core game levels are 1, 1, 3, 3, while the RC villains are 2, 2, 4, 4.</p>",
