        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-22T20:20:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The rating number is just a number, meant to give some idea of the relative difficulty of the villains.</p><p>you should always play with between three and five heroes.</p><p>The increase in difficulty on advanced varies wildly between different villains, as discussed in this thread. Gloomweaver on his starting side isn't really any more difficult, unless you have purely melee/projectile damage heroes. Voss is much harder. The Ennead are much, much harder</p>",
