        "created_at": "2012-11-22T20:40:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If I'm not mistaken, the tier system was designed as a way to determine how many sentinel points (of the monetary kind) would be recieved for defeating a villain on advanced mode.&nbsp; Given that point, it could be assumed that those ratings are for the advanced mode, and why it doesn't seem to make sense when comparing normal modes of villains.</p>",
